(WORKBOOK: WORKED EXAMPLES AND TRACING) Tj
T*
(PrepWise Synthetic Demo Material - Systematic State Tracing Guide) Tj
T*
(==================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.1 The Purpose of Trace Tables) Tj
T*
(When analyzing complex control flow, tracing state variable-by-variable) Tj
T*
(prevents logic errors and uncovers off-by-one boundary failures.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2.2 Methodology for Constructing a Trace Table) Tj
T*
(1. List all state variables and loop guards as column headers.) Tj
T*
(2. Record row 0 as the initial state before loop entry.) Tj
T*
(3. For each iteration, evaluate the loop guard condition.) Tj
T*
(4. Record new values in the row only when an assignment occurs.) Tj
T*
(5. Continue until the loop guard evaluates to False.) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 40 Td
(PrepWise Synthetic Demo Material  |  Page 1 of 4) Tj
ET
endstream
