BT
/F1 12 Tf
50 750 Td
16 TL
(WORKBOOK: WORKED EXAMPLES AND TRACING) Tj
T*
(PrepWise Synthetic Demo Material - Worked Example 1: While-Loop Trace) Tj
T*
(=====================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Given the following code snippet:) Tj
T*
(    total = 0) Tj
T*
(    num = 2) Tj
T*
(    while num <= 6:) Tj
T*
(        total += num) Tj
T*
(        num += 2) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Trace Table Analysis:) Tj
T*
(Step  | num  | num <= 6? | total \(before\) | total += num | num += 2) Tj
T*
(------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Init  | 2    | \(entry\)   | 0              | -            | -) Tj
T*
(Iter1 | 2    | True      | 0              | 2            | 4) Tj
T*
(Iter2 | 4    | True      | 2              | 6            | 6) Tj
T*
(Iter3 | 6    | True      | 6              | 12           | 8) Tj
T*
(Exit  | 8    | False     | 12             | -            | -) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Final Values at Program Termination:) Tj
T*
(total = 12, num = 8 \(Note that num reaches 8 to falsify the condition!\).) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 40 Td
(PrepWise Synthetic Demo Material  |  Page 2 of 4) Tj
