/F1 12 Tf
50 750 Td
16 TL
(WORKBOOK: WORKED EXAMPLES AND TRACING) Tj
T*
(PrepWise Synthetic Demo Material - Common Pitfalls and Bug Catalog) Tj
T*
(==================================================================) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pitfall 1: Off-By-One Bound in range\(\)) Tj
T*
(Bug: range\(1, 5\) iterates 4 times with values 1, 2, 3, 4.) Tj
T*
(If you need 1 through 5 inclusive, use range\(1, 6\).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pitfall 2: Re-initializing the Accumulator Inside the Loop) Tj
T*
(Bug: Putting total = 0 inside the while block resets the accumulator) Tj
T*
(on every iteration, leaving only the final element's value.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Pitfall 3: Inadvertent Infinite Loop) Tj
T*
(Bug: Incrementing the wrong variable or placing counter increment) Tj
T*
(inside an if block that fails to trigger.) Tj
T*
(    while i < 10:) Tj
T*
(        if i % 2 == 0:) Tj
T*
(            i += 1  # If i is odd, it becomes an infinite loop!) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 10 Tf
50 40 Td
(PrepWise Synthetic Demo Material  |  Page 3 of 4) Tj
ET
endstream
