T*
() Tj
T*
(Exercise A: Factorial Product Accumulator) Tj
T*
(Problem: Write a loop computing n! for n = 5.) Tj
T*
(Rubric:) Tj
T*
(- Initialized product to 1 \(not 0\): 2 pts) Tj
T*
(- Correct loop guard \(counter <= n or counter > 0\): 2 pts) Tj
T*
(- Monotonic decrement/increment of counter: 1 pt) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Exercise B: Identify the Termination Bug) Tj
T*
(Snippet:) Tj
T*
(    k = 10) Tj
T*
(    while k > 0:) Tj
T*
(        print\(k\)) Tj
T*
(        # Missing: k -= 1) Tj
T*
(Diagnostic: k is never modified; condition k > 0 is perpetually True.) Tj
T*
(Correction: Insert k -= 1 inside the loop body.) Tj
T*
